<div class="graphics-article-title" >
  Quarantined In The Shop
  <div style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 14px; max-width: 223px; margin: 6px auto; padding-top: 6px; border-top: 1px solid #fff;">
  SS20 tees and shorts with Founder/Designer Pete Macnee
  </div>
</div>
<div>
  <img id="main-image" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/adsum-DSC_6061_6a42ab0e-acc9-457c-8ea8-693c07d0a1a9.jpg?v=1585072485">
</div>
<div class="centered-article-text">
  <p>
    This past week our world changed. The COVID-19 virus is showing there is no border, business or life that it can’t reach to have an impact on. Our manufacturing and wholesale partners all over the world are at a standstill with their brick and mortar locations not being allowed to operate, their warehouses can’t accept new season product and, in some cases, factories and airlines aren’t operational. The hose has been kinked and everyone is wondering what to do. 
  </p>
</div>

