<div class="centered-article-text">
  <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; max-width: 500px; margin: 20px auto;">
    We’ve decided we need to do what we can in a safe manner, respecting how intense the situation is in our neck of the woods and elsewhere for others. To that end, last week our founder Pete went to the store to make sure everything was in order since it's been shuttered for a week. With the door shut to the crisis outside, he took photos of himself in shorts and tees from the Drop 1 SS20 collection on a sunny afternoon at our flagship, 97 North 7th Street in Brooklyn, NY. 
  </p>
</div>

