<div class="centered-article-text">
  <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; max-width: 500px; margin: 20px auto;">
    Drop 1 features two types of shorts, one new style, the Effo Short, and the Bank Short, which has been a summer staple since our first season. The Bank Short features a new, fully functional 4.5 ykk locking zipper fly and snap button closure. We used the same braided round drawcord with branded metal tips and set them into the interior of the waistband with military style eyelet reinforcement. Another major change to the bank short is the implementation of the same dense 30s twill- used on the Asymmetrical Workshirt as the main body fabric on the short. The fabric is an upgrade from past season's typewriter cloth as it will be stronger and feels better against the skin with its ultra fine peached face. 
  </p>
