    The Effo Short is meant for warm days that require a casual short with the added utility of side seam hand pockets and a velcro closure back patch pocket. The short is fully lined for comfort and so that your briefs aren’t visible to passerbys. We chose a crinkle nylon fabric for the short, which has a dense hand but is soft to touch. Nylon is prized for its strength especially in comparison to its sibling polyester. 
