 <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; max-width: 500px; margin: 20px auto;">
   Our Graphic Tees have the same fit as our Core Tee however they use a smooth heavy 250 GSM combed cotton jersey from India. Drop 1 artwork includes the Block and Clover designs. 
   The Block Design is an ode to the abstract art of American artist Ellsworth Kelly and 
